  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fNz5/87",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">갑압 용기에 초코파이 넣는 실험은 <br>많은 분들이 해보셨겠지만,<br>기압센서를 용기에 넣고, 실시간으로 공기를 빼면서 용기 속 기압이 내려가는 것을 보는 것은 많이 안하셨을 것이다!<br><br>나는 기압이 내려감에 따라<br>풍선의 부피가 커지는 것만 본 것이 아니라<br>풍선이 터지는 순간, 그래프에 그 사건이 반영되고<br>학생들이 그것을 해석할 수 있도록 하는 것이<br>목표였다.<br><br>일단, 물풍선 불어서 준비해두고</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/175e8f901e1de407f24bdcc9755445eac6289ee8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/175e8f901e1de407f24bdcc9755445eac6289ee8\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">무선보드+기압센서+갑압용기 준비 완료!<br>(뒤에 있는 공기압 센서는 다음시간 해볼 예정)</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/225d29b31091772bc68f62d2e93b3b60c29ea85a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/225d29b31091772bc68f62d2e93b3b60c29ea85a\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">전체적으로 실험실은 이렇게 세팅!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9a81b39691af8c4be1829156e0e47d7f1843445e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9a81b39691af8c4be1829156e0e47d7f1843445e\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">애들은 이제 설명 듣고, <br>가이드 종이 없이도 잘 조립한다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/20d2232a73fa4700e4c2e41428c5a702f337c1dd\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/20d2232a73fa4700e4c2e41428c5a702f337c1dd\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7d304624ed6713b088d89a3caa91d547515f48c9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7d304624ed6713b088d89a3caa91d547515f48c9\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">요렇게 기압 센서를 풍선 위에 붙힌다.<br>이게 풍선만 위에 두면, 공기를 빼다가<br>풍선이 공기빼는 구멍을 막는다<br>이렇게 해야 공기가 잘빠진다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7562a7490b987764e6b455926229cc2fce4ab8bf\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7562a7490b987764e6b455926229cc2fce4ab8bf\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e4cedf73e487b298e0dfa7cf5c4d82685e7c97d4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e4cedf73e487b298e0dfa7cf5c4d82685e7c97d4\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">공기를 빼면서 기압 변화를 보고</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9e3999770794cb059dc528ff219f58cbd9b90724\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9e3999770794cb059dc528ff219f58cbd9b90724\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">터졌을 때 그래프를 본다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/383cd4151a5c35ebc9a59f106359e787ea7e31dd\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/383cd4151a5c35ebc9a59f106359e787ea7e31dd\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">기압이 내려가다가, 터지면 기압이 오른다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5ceab941485bee44c117d64ff8dad62ec71bfb96\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5ceab941485bee44c117d64ff8dad62ec71bfb96\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"900\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">앞에 나와서 시범 보여주는 것<br>대신 해주는 친구들 두 명이 참 열심히 해줬다</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/493ad08d3748849917bf16e22c4c7a0dac0ca58c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/493ad08d3748849917bf16e22c4c7a0dac0ca58c\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"900\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">실험이 끝나고 애들은, 실험 그래프 사진과<br>간단한 실험 내용을 적는다</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/26b77c78e3de459657d6b998e4a37ddb11b72a77\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/26b77c78e3de459657d6b998e4a37ddb11b72a77\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">다음 시간은 공기압 센서로<br>보일의 법칙 실험을 해보려한다!<br>아자아자 화이팅!!<br><br>[네이버 블로그] 블로그를 소개합니다.<br>쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 | 최효석<br><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 : 네이버 블로그\" data-og-description=\"영서중학교 과학교사(물리 전공)입니다! 항상 새로운 수업을 만들고자 합니다\" data-og-host=\"m.blog.naver.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bhL2t1/dJMb83kJ1iA/3lwBxk0AFl2EtYMLkARIik/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=204&amp;height=204\"><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bhL2t1/dJMb83kJ1iA/3lwBxk0AFl2EtYMLkARIik/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=204&amp;height=204\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 : 네이버 블로그</p><p class=\"og-desc\">영서중학교 과학교사(물리 전공)입니다! 항상 새로운 수업을 만들고자 합니다</p><p class=\"og-host\">m.blog.naver.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
